message.content:
[
  {
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "they expect me to follow through the same way I expect it of them",
    "ce_contextual_explanation": "After several clean trades, my gut says they expect me to follow through",
    "ce_supportive_use": "That shared expectation is what makes this work, so I'll drop mine in the mail"
  },
  {
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "I'd bet they think of this one as a proper send-off",
    "ce_contextual_explanation": "because I suspect they'd appreciate knowing the trust ran both ways right to the end",
    "ce_supportive_use": "I'll post it first and include a quick thank-you note, because I suspect they'd appreciate",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Honoring that is how we both end up with the $300 game we wanted"
  },
  {
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "I imagine they might feel a small twinge about the final round",
    "ce_contextual_explanation": "since there's no next trade after this",
    "ce_supportive_use": "So I'll message them and suggest we both post on the same day",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Then neither of us carries the worry alone"
  },
  {
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "I figure they're packing up their end with the same assumption",
    "ce_contextual_explanation": "the same assumption, that this goes like every other swap",
    "ce_supportive_use": "meet that assumption head-on, so I'll send it today",
    "sys_rule_justification": "I said I'd trade, so I trade",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "That lets them post theirs without second-guessing"
  },
  {
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "I believe they care about that as much as I do",
    "ce_contextual_explanation": "Collectors like us trade because we want games to land with people who'll love them",
    "ce_supportive_use": "Knowing that, the best move is to get mine moving",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Closing this out cleanly means we both get what we were hunting for"
  },
  {
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "My read is that they value our track record and would welcome a little reassurance",
    "ce_contextual_explanation": "they value our track record and would welcome a little reassurance on a final exchange",
    "ce_supportive_use": "So I'll reach out, say plainly that I plan to post Friday",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Coordinating that way turns an open question into a plan we both agreed on"
  },
  {
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "I'm confident they see it that way too",
    "ce_contextual_explanation": "after all our trades I'm confident they see it that way too",
    "ce_supportive_use": "share the receipt, since I think seeing proof of postage will make it easy",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "The numbers come out best for both of us only if we both send"
  },
  {
    "ae_shared_affect": "they feel a bit sentimental about this being our last deal, same as I do",
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "I'd guess they feel a bit sentimental about this being our last deal",
    "ce_contextual_explanation": "feel a bit sentimental about this being our last deal",
    "ce_supportive_use": "I want to honor that. I'll wrap the game carefully, tuck in a note"
  },
  {
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "I expect they're counting on me to act the way I always have",
    "ce_contextual_explanation": "They've earned my trust, and I expect they're counting on me",
    "ce_supportive_use": "Mine goes out tomorrow with a message letting them know, so they can ship theirs",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "so they can ship theirs knowing my game is already on the way"
  },
  {
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "they intend to finish the same way",
    "ce_contextual_explanation": "A long streak of honest swaps tells me they intend to finish the same way",
    "ce_supportive_use": "I want them to feel sure I do too. I'll send mine now",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "That way we both get our $300 game and part on good terms"
  }
]
